{"id":"cc2918e3bcba86c2","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse.md","title":"同极性合一造成集合文字合并","display":"ex-first-order-factoring-collapse — 同极性合一造成集合文字合并","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse","aliases":["72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse"],"display":"ex-first-order-factoring-collapse — 同极性合一造成集合文字合并","depends_on":["[[72-df-first-order-factoring]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.6.2 print61–62/PDF73–74; complete local factoring example","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-first-order-factoring-collapse — 同极性合一造成集合文字合并"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e522095533d0175f\" href=\"?note=e522095533d0175f\" title=\"72-df-first-order-factoring\">72-df-first-order-factoring</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.6.2 print61–62/PDF73–74; complete local factoring example"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\">\\(p\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\)</span> 元数为1，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in V\">\\(x,y\\in V\\)</span> 互异，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C:=\\{p(x),p(y)\\}\">\\(C:=\\{p(x),p(y)\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(x):=y\">\\(\\theta(x):=y\\)</span>，其余变量保持不动。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C\\theta=\\{p(y)\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Factor}(C,\\theta,\\{p(y)\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C\\theta=\\{p(y)\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Factor}(C,\\theta,\\{p(y)\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|C|=2,\\qquad|C\\theta|=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|C|=2,\\qquad|C\\theta|=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>统一子族的方程只有x=y及反向和恒等方程，θ为MGU：任一统一子σ满足σ(x)=σ(y)，于是θ⋆σ=σ。集合像合并两个相同输出。该例给因子化的实际数学效果，没有把序列中的文字数目当作集合基数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-first-order-factoring","status":"resolved","id":"e522095533d0175f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-factoring]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"C:=\\{p(x),p(y)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta(x):=y","display":false},{"tex":"C\\theta=\\{p(y)\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Factor}(C,\\theta,\\{p(y)\\}).","display"